src(4,'Jyotiraditya Scindia joins Congress','Pervez Bari / Arab News','https://www.arabnews.com/archive/217057','2001-12-19','Journalism','Report of 18 December admission and expected Guna candidacy','Sonia Gandhi admitted him to Congress on 18 December 2001. Entry followed his father’s death; Guna candidacy was anticipated. He deferred to party leadership and senior colleagues.','Contemporaneous account supports family succession and party sponsorship; it does not isolate gender or explain later voter behaviour.')
src(5,'Scindia assumes charge as Civil Aviation Minister','Ministry of Civil Aviation / PIB','https://www.pib.gov.in/PressReleasePage.aspx?PRID=1734222','2021-07-09','Official record','Charge-taking paragraphs','Assumed Civil Aviation charge on 9 July 2021, succeeding Hardeep Singh Puri.','Charge-taking is not oath date. Biographical paragraph says Communications 2007–09; S001 and S006 support 2008. That conflicting year is excluded.',method='Canonical HTML downloaded with curl after web access failed; text inspected locally')
